如果方法是异步的，必须使用await并处理异常：
```csharp
if (createAppleLocalPriceList.Count > 0) {
    foreach (var item in createAppleLocalPriceList) {
        try {
            await AppStoreConnectAPIService.GetLocalPrice(req.AppGroup, item).ConfigureAwait(false);
        } catch (Exception ex) {
            Logger.Error(ex, "创建Apple本地价格失败: AppGroup={AppGroup}, SubscriptionGroup={SubscriptionGroup}", req.AppGroup, item);
            // 根据业务需求决定是否继续或抛出异常
        }
    }
}
```
