提取为私有方法以减少重复：
```csharp
private void ProcessAppleSubscriptionGroup(
    List<KeyValuePair<string, string>> appleSubscriptionGroupList,
    string subscriptionGroupKey,
    int couponKind,
    List<string> createAppleLocalPriceList) {
    var sub = appleSubscriptionGroupList.FirstOrDefault(s => s.key == subscriptionGroupKey);
    if (sub != null) {
        var idx = sub.value.IndexOf('-');
        var name = idx >= 0 ? sub.value.Substring(idx + 1) : sub.value;
        DictionaryHelper.AbroadAddDictionaryKeyValue("CouponKindList", couponKind.ToString(), name, "");
        createAppleLocalPriceList.Add(subscriptionGroupKey);
    }
}
```
